    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Prohibition";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibits holding out as an accredited person.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) A person commits an offence if the person holds out that the person:  (a) is an accredited person; or  (b) is an accredited person holding an accreditation that has been granted at a particular level (see paragraph 56BH(1)(d)); or  (c) is an accredited data recipient of CDR data; if that is not the case.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(Penalty—body corporate)";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
