    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(5) If an act or omission constitutes:  (a) a contravention of one or more of the privacy safeguard penalty provisions; and  (b) a contravention of one or more civil penalty provisions of the consumer data rules; proceedings may be instituted against a person in relation to the contravention of any one or more of those provisions.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "Proceedings may not be instituted against a person in relation to contravention of certain provisions.";
